From 5cc116250cdb5b35e7a1fd1df247585aa562a352 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 15:36:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: deliver contact leads by email, honest proof copy,
 crawlable contact links, lighter media

- Contact API now emails every lead via Gmail SMTP (nodemailer + App Password).
  If delivery is not configured or fails, it returns 503 with a WhatsApp/phone
  fallback instead of a false "enquiry received".
- Contact email/phone/WhatsApp render as plain crawlable links read from site-config
  (no more "[Email Protected]" in server HTML); clicks are tracked.
- Single public email: minmurasu.digital@gmail.com; domain: minmurasu.digital.
- Work page reframed as solution blueprints (removed NDA/client-result claims);
  "Case Studies Coming Soon" heading; hero badge "Your Data, Your Accounts".
- Industry titles unified between content and site-config.
- New 1200x630 OG image; schema logo uses transparent logo PNG.
- Site plays a 1080p (6 MB) intro with a poster; 4K master and print files
  moved to assets/ (not publicly served); unused images and starter SVGs removed.
- Intro video outro updated to minmurasu.digital and the Gmail address.
- README and .env.example updated (Gmail vars, brand colours, phone typo).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NE1gqApPZAnu1yDPhHhw3h
